{"title": "Freecast", "pageid": 16292, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Freecast", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Toggleable passive features", "Illithid Powers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Freecast.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Freecast.webp/300px-Freecast.webp, /w/images/d/d0/Freecast.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Freecast.webp/300px-Freecast.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Freecast.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Freecast</b> is a toggleable passive feature and a <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Powers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Powers\">power</a> available to <a href=\"/wiki/Partial-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Partial-Illithid\">Partial-Illithids</a>. It allows them to bypass the normal expenditure of spell slots, charges or other similar resource costs for their next chosen <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a>, once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You have discovered a marvellous adaptability within yourself. Spell slots, charges, and similar resource costs for your next action or spell are removed. Refreshes after a <b>Long Rest</b>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd><dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>After becoming a <a href=\"/wiki/Partial-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Partial-Illithid\">Partial-Illithid</a>, unlock from the <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> skill tree with a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a> after obtaining one of the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Thralls\" title=\"Shield of Thralls\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Shield_of_Thralls_Icon.webp/20px-Shield_of_Thralls_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Shield_of_Thralls_Icon.webp/30px-Shield_of_Thralls_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Shield_of_Thralls_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_of_Thralls_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield of Thralls\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Shield_of_Thralls_Icon.webp/20px-Shield_of_Thralls_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Shield_of_Thralls_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_of_Thralls\" title=\"Shield of Thralls\">Shield of Thralls</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/30px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/40px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Mind_Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Sanctuary\" title=\"Mind Sanctuary\">Mind Sanctuary</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>If an action takes more than one type of resource (e.g., <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Quickened_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/20px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/30px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/40px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp/20px-Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Metamagic_Quickened_Spell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic:_Quickened_Spell\" title=\"Metamagic: Quickened Spell\">Metamagic: Quickened Spell</a> with any spell that is not a cantrip), both costs are removed.</li>\n<li>Prior to <a href=\"/wiki/Patch_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Patch 6\">Patch 6</a>, this feature did not remove <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Channel_Oath_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Oath_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Channel_Oath_Icon.png/30px-Channel_Oath_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4a/Channel_Oath_Icon.png/40px-Channel_Oath_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4a/Channel_Oath_Icon.png/20px-Channel_Oath_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4a/Channel_Oath_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Oath_Charge\" title=\"Channel Oath Charge\">Channel Oath Charge</a> costs.</li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Arcane_Arrow_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Arcane_Arrow_Resource_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Arcane_Arrow_Resource_Icon.png/30px-Arcane_Arrow_Resource_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Arcane_Arrow_Resource_Icon.png/40px-Arcane_Arrow_Resource_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Arcane_Arrow_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Arcane_Arrow_Resource_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Arcane_Arrow_Resource_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Arrow\" title=\"Arcane Arrow\">Arcane Arrow</a>, <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Bladesong_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Bladesong_Resource_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Bladesong_Resource_Icon.png/30px-Bladesong_Resource_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Bladesong_Resource_Icon.png/40px-Bladesong_Resource_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Bladesong_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Bladesong_Resource_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Bladesong_Resource_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Power\" title=\"Bladesong Power\">Bladesong Power</a>, <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png/30px-Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png/40px-Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Cosmic_Omen_Resource_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Omen_(resource)\" title=\"Cosmic Omen (resource)\">Cosmic Omen</a>, <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Fungal_Infestation_Charge_Icon.png/20px-Fungal_Infestation_Charge_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Fungal_Infestation_Charge_Icon.png/30px-Fungal_Infestation_Charge_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/18/Fungal_Infestation_Charge_Icon.png/40px-Fungal_Infestation_Charge_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/18/Fungal_Infestation_Charge_Icon.png/20px-Fungal_Infestation_Charge_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/18/Fungal_Infestation_Charge_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Spores#Level_6\" title=\"Circle of the Spores\">Fungal Infestation Charge</a>, <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png/30px-Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png/40px-Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Star_Map_Resource_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Map\" title=\"Star Map\">Star Map</a>, and <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Writhing_Current_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Writhing_Current_Resource_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Writhing_Current_Resource_Icon.png/30px-Writhing_Current_Resource_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Writhing_Current_Resource_Icon.png/40px-Writhing_Current_Resource_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Writhing_Current_Resource_Icon.png/20px-Writhing_Current_Resource_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Writhing_Current_Resource_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Swarmkeeper#Level_7\" title=\"Swarmkeeper\">Writhing Current</a> action costs are not affected by Freecast.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Freecast can be easily reset by having another character apply a condition (such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guidance_(Condition)\" title=\"Guidance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guidance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guidance_(Condition)\" title=\"Guidance (Condition)\">Guidance</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Protection_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Protection (Aura) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Protection\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Aura_of_Protection_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Protection_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Protection (Aura) (Condition)\">Aura of Protection</a>) on the character seeking to (re)use Freecast.</li>\n<li>Freecast becomes disabled when equipping or unequipping a weapon from the ranged weapon slot.  It can be re-enabled by re-equipping a melee weapon.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195449\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2077/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 